abstract: >-
  Complete open-science replication package and empirical dataset testing five
  popular AI code-review assumptions across 130,000+ real GitHub pull requests
  (99,454 CodeRabbit PRs, 33,596 autonomous coding-agent PRs, 6,618 human
  baselines, 6,004 human reviews across 2,491 maintainers, 553 TypeSafe Jev
  decision-model PRs, and 10,410 merged PRs linked through 300 bare-git SZZ
  commit histories). Contains 36 SHA-256 checksummed JSON, Markdown, and CSV
  evidence artifacts, standalone DuckDB/SciPy analysis scripts, and an 81-check
  one-command verification harness with zero synthetic data.
